      "writtenOn": "2012-11-19T17:08:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "as a workaround, i\u0027d prefer data migrations to be performed separately from schema migrations... so:\n\n  006: schema migration to create new columns\n  007: data migration to move stuff over\n  008: schema migration to drop columns (can be an empty migration for sqlite?)",
